* **`\usepackage{skak}`**: This package provides the chess symbols and fonts required by the chessboard package.
* **`\setchessboard{...}`**: This command allows you to customize the appearance of the board (e.g., turning on/off the indicator for whose turn it is, setting the font, or changing square colors).
* **`\chessboard[setfen=...]`**: This is the core command that parses the FEN string and draws the corresponding pieces in their correct positions on the grid.

